{"term": {"label": "心", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "1A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/liang-hui-wang-i", "title": "梁惠王上", "description": "孟子見梁惠王。王曰：「叟不遠千里而來，亦將有以利吾國乎？」\n孟子對曰：「王何必曰利？亦有仁義而已矣。王曰『何以利吾國』？大夫曰『何以利吾家』？士庶人曰『何以利吾身』？上下交征利而國危矣。萬乘之國弒其君者，必千乘之家；千乘之國弒其君者，必百乘之家。萬取千焉，千取百焉，不為不多矣。苟為後義而先利，不奪不饜。未有仁而遺其親者", "occurrences": 15, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "力", "id": "力"}, {"form": "加", "id": "加"}, {"form": "國", "id": "國"}, {"form": "士", "id": "士"}, {"form": "多", "id": "多"}, {"form": "夫子", "id": "夫子"}, {"form": "寡人", "id": "寡人"}, {"form": "後", "id": "後"}, {"form": "心", "variants": [], "id": "心"}, {"form": "恆", "id": "恆"}, {"form": "教", "id": "敎"}, {"form": "沼", "id": "沼"}, {"form": "甚", "id": "甚"}, {"form": "用", "id": "用"}, {"form": "笑", "id": "笑"}, {"form": "臣", "id": "臣"}, {"form": "臺", "id": "臺"}, {"form": "舉", "id": "舉"}, {"form": "言", "id": "言"}, {"form": "身", "id": "身"}, {"form": "願", "id": "願"}], "edges": [{"weight": 0.5978370007556204, "source": "心", "target": "國"}, {"weight": 1.8787708462176849, "source": "心", "target": "寡人"}, {"weight": 0.8491514290365265, "source": "心", "target": "用"}, {"weight": 1.69644928942373, "source": "心", "target": "加"}, {"weight": 1.69644928942373, "source": "心", "target": "舉"}, {"weight": 1.69644928942373, "source": "心", "target": "言"}, {"weight": 2.7950615780918397, "source": "心", "target": "甚"}, {"weight": 0.49247648509779424, "source": "心", "target": "後"}, {"weight": 1.4087672169719492, "source": "心", "target": "力"}, {"weight": 2.1019143975318944, "source": "心", "target": "士"}, {"weight": 2.7950615780918397, "source": "心", "target": "恆"}, {"weight": 2.995732273553991, "source": "笑", "target": "言"}, {"weight": 1.8971199848858813, "source": "加", "target": "國"}, {"weight": 3.4011973816621555, "source": "加", "target": "多"}, {"weight": 2.995732273553991, "source": "加", "target": "舉"}, {"weight": 2.995732273553991, "source": "加", "target": "言"}, {"weight": 3.401